            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The dracotoad vomits poison, dealing @Damage[3d6[poison]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] (@Check[fortitude|dc:20|basic] save). A creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). The dracotoad can't use Toxic Spew again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Toxic Spew]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "manipulate"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "1QsJFZfF3NQ3MSbQ",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Unsettling Croak",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The dracotoad infuses its croak with draconic menace. All creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] that don't have the dragon trait must attempt a @Check[will|dc:20] save, with the following effects. Regardless of the results of the save, the creatures are temporarily immune to Unsettling Croak for 1 minute. Critical</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
